/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-18T14:48:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T14:48:01Z","body":"We discussed this PR during the last core meeting. We don't want to add `free_children`, since when working with nodes `queue_free` is almost always the way to go.\r\n\r\nAs for `queue_free_children`, we are in favor of adding it, as long as there is a significant performance benefit. Your PR indicates that there is, however we'd like to see a bit more benchmarking for different approaches. Could you please update your benchmarking to measure the following cases on `master`:\r\n- The method added in this PR\r\n- A GDScript side loop using `get_children`\r\n- A GDScript side loop using `get_child_count` and `get_child`\r\n- Adding the children to an intermediate node and freeing that one\r\n\r\nPlease provide the project which you are using for benchmarking, so that we can reproduce the results.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6251277387/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]